# Configuration
additional_aberrations=Additional aberrations
additional_aberrations.tooltip=Entity IDs that take Radiant's bonus damage, e.g. Zombie or Thaumcraft.Wisp. IDs are case-sensitive; use one per entry. Blighters always qualify. Applies immediately; use the same list on the server and clients.
prysmal_ore_harvest_level=Prysmal ore harvest level
prysmal_ore_harvest_level.tooltip=Required pickaxe level: 0 = wood/gold, 1 = stone, 2 = iron, 3 = diamond. Higher levels may be provided by other mods. Use the same setting on the server and clients. Requires a game restart.
lifesight_potion_id=Lifesight effect ID
lifesight_potion_id.tooltip=Use -1 to choose and save an unused ID automatically, or an unused ID from 1 to 127. Must match on the server and clients. Changing IDs requires a game restart.
poison_immunity_potion_id=Poison Immunity effect ID
poison_immunity_potion_id.tooltip=Use -1 to choose and save an unused ID automatically, or an unused ID from 1 to 127. Must match on the server and clients. Changing IDs requires a game restart.
immixer_3d_bottles=3D Immixer bottles and holders
immixer_3d_bottles.tooltip=Use 3D bottles, holders and upper bars instead of flat sprites like a vanilla brewing stand. Client-side only; applies immediately.
generate_prysmal_ore=Generate Prysmal ore
generate_prysmal_ore.tooltip=Generate Prysmal ore in new Overworld chunks. Existing ore is not removed. Uses the server's setting in multiplayer.
rift_taint_spread=Rift taint spreading
rift_taint_spread.tooltip=Allow rifts to spread tainted biomes and fibrous taint in the Overworld. Does not remove existing taint or affect other Thaumcraft spreading sources. Uses the server's setting in multiplayer; applies immediately.
